OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS announces new tariff proposals on
OL,4,AEU, China, and other trade partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut our business reporter says the
OL,7,Factual rates paid will be far lower due
OL,8,Fto trade deals Donald Trump has struck
OL,9,Fwith many countries
OL,11,FSo, for example, the tariff on Chinese
OL,12,Fgoods should remain at 10% for now -
OL,13,Fbut today's move could give the US
OL,14,Fleverage in ongoing talks, our reporter
OL,15,Fsays
OL,17,FThe EU, meanwhile says the tariff on
OL,18,FEuropean goods entering the US will
OL,19,Fremain at a previously agreed 15%
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
