OL,3,AUS announces new tariff proposals on
OL,4,AEU, China, and other trade partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese latest proposals come after the
OL,7,FSupreme Court struck down Trump's
OL,8,F'Liberation Day' tariffs. The US claims
OL,9,Fthe targeted trading partners have
OL,10,F"excess capacity and production"
